#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The interaction of this function with SIGALRM and other timer functions "
#| "such as I<sleep>(), I<alarm>(), I<setitimer>(), I<nanosleep>()  is "
#| "unspecified.  This function is obsolete. Use B<nanosleep>(2)  or "
#| "B<setitimer>(2)  instead."
msgid ""
"The interaction of this function with the B<SIGALRM> signal, and with other "
"timer functions such as B<alarm>(2), B<sleep>(3), B<nanosleep>(2), "
"B<setitimer>(2), B<timer_create>(2), B<timer_delete>(2), "
"B<timer_getoverrun>(2), B<timer_gettime>(2), B<timer_settime>(2), "
"B<ualarm>(3)  is unspecified."
msgstr ""
"A interação desta função com SIGALARM e outras funções de tempo, tais como: "
"I<sleep>(), I<alarm>(), I<setitimer>(), I<nanosleep>() não são "
"especificadas. Esta função é obsoleta. Use B<nanosleep>(2) ou "
"B<setitimer>(2) em seu lugar."

